        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FPV10225, 10\" Victorian Barn Door Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis victorian style 10 inch flush pull is perfect for barn doors. It is easy to install and is a great way to add an ornate touch to any sliding door. Flush Pulls like this one can also be used on sliding barn doors, cabinet doors, closets, and pocket doors. It is available in 4 finishes including antique brass and oil-rubbed bronze.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available in a <a href=\"/products/7-inch-victorian-flush-pull-deltana-fpv7178\">7\" Victorian Flush Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the 10\" Victorian Barn Door Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounts using 4 screws--2 on the top and 2 on the bottom.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FPV10225-specifications.pdf?v=1704262323\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FPV10225 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually<i>\r\n</p>",
